<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>1.15.3: Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00334</md:content-id>
    <md:title>1.15.3: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>03a32096-a4fe-4ce2-aef5-809b94292c70</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para dir="ltr">Sophia is making parts for a model ship. The number of parts, \( p \), she can make in a day varies directly with the number of hours, \( h \), she works. She can make 28 parts in 4 hours. How many parts would Sophia make in 9 hours?</para></section>
</content>
</document>
